    {
      "id": "e001007",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 52,
      "y": 317.6,
      "width": 249.591796875,
      "height": 75,
      "text": "• 每 follower 一个线程\n• 比对 heartbeat_seq_ 决定是否发\n• 落后→InstallSnapshot\n• 否则 AppendEntries(空/带日志)\n• voter, learner角色均可，remove仅可接收心跳",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• 每 follower 一个线程\n• 比对 heartbeat_seq_ 决定是否发\n• 落后→InstallSnapshot\n• 否则 AppendEntries(空/带日志)\n• voter, learner角色均可，remove仅可接收心跳",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 12,
      "angle": 0,
