    {
      "id": "e001010",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 52,
      "y": 517.6,
      "width": 240.767578125,
      "height": 105,
      "text": "• 单发送者：从 pending 取快照\n• 锁外 push 到 applyCh\n• 投递 committed entry 给 KV\n• 避免与 InstallSnapshot 穿插\n• 应用ProposeConfChangeTo发起的角色变更\n  日志，并清空pending_conf_index_在途变更\n  配置标志",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• 单发送者：从 pending 取快照\n• 锁外 push 到 applyCh\n• 投递 committed entry 给 KV\n• 避免与 InstallSnapshot 穿插\n• 应用ProposeConfChangeTo发起的角色变更\n  日志，并清空pending_conf_index_在途变更\n  配置标志",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 12,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
