    {
      "id": "e001027",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 692,
      "y": 308,
      "width": 266,
      "height": 18.2,
      "text": "ReadIndex (线性一致读点)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ReadIndex (线性一致读点)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 14,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "seed": 25215623,
      "version": 6,
      "versionNonce": 1632000936,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790840629681,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "bbU",
      "roundness": null,
      "created": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "e001028",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 692,
      "y": 327.6,
      "width": 272.6249694824219,
      "height": 196.40994221839873,
      "text": "• 每读请求判断身份是否为新leader(防旧leader)\n• 发带 read_ctx 空心跳（read_ctx用来使Get请求\n  可以并发执行，raft会为每个请求发送唯一递增ctx\n  号）\n• 收多数follower回应且大于read_safe_index可读\n  commitIndex.\n• 必须等 lastApplied>=ri (commitindex)才读\n• 孤立旧 leader 靠超时兜底(坑D)\n• 仅voter节点角色可接收带read_ctx的空心跳\n• follower也允许读，可能读的值稍旧，但不会破坏\n  线性一致，他会将读请求挂入当前在飞轮合并读请\n  求，转发给leader，leader确认自己仍为leader后\n  返回当前 commit_index",
      "fontSize": 12.086765674978384,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• 每读请求判断身份是否为新leader(防旧leader)\n• 发带 read_ctx 空心跳（read_ctx用来使Get请求\n  可以并发执行，raft会为每个请求发送唯一递增ctx\n  号）\n• 收多数follower回应且大于read_safe_index可读\n  commitIndex.\n• 必须等 lastApplied>=ri (commitindex)才读\n• 孤立旧 leader 靠超时兜底(坑D)\n• 仅voter节点角色可接收带read_ctx的空心跳\n• follower也允许读，可能读的值稍旧，但不会破坏\n  线性一致，他会将读请求挂入当前在飞轮合并读请\n  求，转发给leader，leader确认自己仍为leader后\n  返回当前 commit_index",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 12,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
